{"route":"/news-highlights/1421-union-health-minister-shri-j-p-nadda-releases-10th-edition-of-indian-pharmacopoeia-ip-2026","kind":"news","crumbs":[{"label":"News & Highlights","href":"/news-highlights"},{"label":"Union Health Minister Shri J. P. Nadda Releases 10th Edition of Indian Pharmacopoeia -IP 2026"}],"updated":"2026-01-02","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/news-highlights.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/news-highlights/1421-union-health-minister-shri-j-p-nadda-releases-10th-edition-of-indian-pharmacopoeia-ip-2026.html","title":"Union Health Minister Shri J. P. Nadda Releases 10th Edition of Indian Pharmacopoeia -IP 2026","bodyHtml":"<p>Union Minister for Health and Family Welfare and Chemicals and Fertilizers, Shri J. P. Nadda, today released the Indian Pharmacopoeia 2026 (IP 2026) - the 10th edition of India’s official book of drug standards at Dr. Ambedkar International Centre, New Delhi, marking a significant milestone in India’s ongoing efforts to strengthen the quality, safety, and efficacy of medicines.</p>\n<p>The Indian Pharmacopoeia 2026 incorporated 121 new monographs, increasing the total number of monographs to 3,340.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IP_Recognition/IP-26-release.jpeg\" alt=\"Image: Union Health Minister Shri J. P. Nadda Releases 10th Edition of Indian Pharmacopoeia -IP 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IP_Recognition/IP-26-Stage-view.jpeg\" alt=\"Image: Union Health Minister Shri J. P. Nadda Releases 10th Edition of Indian Pharmacopoeia -IP 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IP_Recognition/IP-26-HFM-wlcm.jpeg\" alt=\"Image: Union Health Minister Shri J. P. Nadda Releases 10th Edition of Indian Pharmacopoeia -IP 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IP_Recognition/IP-26-HFM-on-dias.jpeg\" alt=\"Image: Union Health Minister Shri J. P. Nadda Releases 10th Edition of Indian Pharmacopoeia -IP 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IP_Recognition/IP-26-Sec-wlcm.jpeg\" alt=\"Image: Union Health Minister Shri J. P. Nadda Releases 10th Edition of Indian Pharmacopoeia -IP 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IP_Recognition/IP-26-audiance.jpeg\" alt=\"Image: Union Health Minister Shri J. P. Nadda Releases 10th Edition of Indian Pharmacopoeia -IP 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>","date":"2026-01-02","category":"Publications & Standards"}